{"content_hash": "4c5ea87614301180", "version_id": 105, "article_id": 11, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Author Correction: Palladium Membrane Hydrogen Extraction Boosts Dehydrogenation", "title_zh": "作者更正：钯膜阳极提氢可强化热化学脱氢", "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11244-6", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51733627413_8ff72ca7da_b.jpg", "credit": "₡ґǘșϯγ Ɗᶏ Ⱪᶅṏⱳդ · cc0 1.0 · via flickr"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 223, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "A correction has been issued for a Nature study on palladium membranes and hydrogen extraction, rectifying a mislabelled bar in one figure. The underlying findings remain unchanged.", "lead_zh": "《自然》杂志近日发布了一篇关于钯膜与氢气提取研究的更正声明，修正了图表中一处标注错误。研究本身的结论并未受到影响。", "preview": "On 6 October 2026, Nature published an author correction to a study originally released on 9 September 2026. The paper, titled “Anodic Pd me", "preview_zh": "2026年10月6日，《自然》杂志针对2026年9月9日首发的一项研究发布了一则作者更正。该论文题为《阳极钯膜提氢增强热化学脱氢》，作者为曾瑞、Julian Ufert、Bryan Y. Tang、Ryan P. Bisbey和Yogesh Surendranath，均隶属于麻省", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 95, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@ab49ecc/content/audio/11/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 104.425, "size_bytes": 630288, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 262, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@ab49ecc/content/data/versions/105.json", "paragraphs": ["On 6 October 2026, Nature published an author correction to a study originally released on 9 September 2026. The paper, titled “Anodic Pd membrane H2 extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation,” was authored by Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath, affiliated with the Department of Chemistry and the Department of Chemical Engineering at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology. The correction addresses a labelling error in Figure 3c, where the far-left bar was mistakenly identified as “Pd-Ag under OCP” instead of “Pd under OCP.”", "Such corrections, while seemingly minor, are crucial for maintaining the integrity of the scientific record. The mislabelling could have led to misinterpretation of the experimental conditions, potentially affecting how other researchers replicate or build upon the work. The authors have updated both the HTML and PDF versions of the article to reflect the correct label. The original findings, which demonstrate that anodic palladium membranes facilitate hydrogen extraction and thereby enhance thermochemical dehydrogenation, remain unaffected.", "The study falls within the domains of chemical engineering, electrocatalysis, and heterogeneous catalysis, subjects that often involve intricate experimental setups and precise data representation. By promptly issuing this correction, the authors and the journal uphold transparency and rigor, ensuring that the scientific community can rely on accurate information. Readers are encouraged to refer to the updated version for the corrected figure."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2026年10月6日，《自然》杂志针对2026年9月9日首发的一项研究发布了一则作者更正。该论文题为《阳极钯膜提氢增强热化学脱氢》，作者为曾瑞、Julian Ufert、Bryan Y. Tang、Ryan P. Bisbey和Yogesh Surendranath，均隶属于麻省理工学院化学系和化学工程系。更正涉及图3c中的一处标注错误：最左侧的柱状条被误标为“开路电位下的钯银”，正确应为“开路电位下的钯”。", "此类更正看似微不足道，实则对维护科学记录的严谨性至关重要。标注错误可能导致对实验条件的误读，进而影响其他研究者重复或拓展该工作。作者已更新论文的HTML和PDF版本，以反映正确的标注。原研究的主要发现——即阳极钯膜促进氢气提取，从而增强热化学脱氢——并未受到影响。", "该研究属于化学工程、电催化和多相催化领域，这些领域通常涉及复杂的实验装置和精确的数据呈现。作者与期刊迅速发布更正，彰显了透明度和严谨性，确保科学界能够依赖准确的信息。建议读者参阅更新后的版本以获取修正后的图表。"], "body": "On 6 October 2026, Nature published an author correction to a study originally released on 9 September 2026. The paper, titled “Anodic Pd membrane H2 extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation,” was authored by Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath, affiliated with the Department of Chemistry and the Department of Chemical Engineering at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology. The correction addresses a labelling error in Figure 3c, where the far-left bar was mistakenly identified as “Pd-Ag under OCP” instead of “Pd under OCP.”\n\nSuch corrections, while seemingly minor, are crucial for maintaining the integrity of the scientific record. The mislabelling could have led to misinterpretation of the experimental conditions, potentially affecting how other researchers replicate or build upon the work. The authors have updated both the HTML and PDF versions of the article to reflect the correct label. The original findings, which demonstrate that anodic palladium membranes facilitate hydrogen extraction and thereby enhance thermochemical dehydrogenation, remain unaffected.\n\nThe study falls within the domains of chemical engineering, electrocatalysis, and heterogeneous catalysis, subjects that often involve intricate experimental setups and precise data representation. By promptly issuing this correction, the authors and the journal uphold transparency and rigor, ensuring that the scientific community can rely on accurate information. Readers are encouraged to refer to the updated version for the corrected figure.", "body_zh": "2026年10月6日，《自然》杂志针对2026年9月9日首发的一项研究发布了一则作者更正。该论文题为《阳极钯膜提氢增强热化学脱氢》，作者为曾瑞、Julian Ufert、Bryan Y. Tang、Ryan P. Bisbey和Yogesh Surendranath，均隶属于麻省理工学院化学系和化学工程系。更正涉及图3c中的一处标注错误：最左侧的柱状条被误标为“开路电位下的钯银”，正确应为“开路电位下的钯”。\n\n此类更正看似微不足道，实则对维护科学记录的严谨性至关重要。标注错误可能导致对实验条件的误读，进而影响其他研究者重复或拓展该工作。作者已更新论文的HTML和PDF版本，以反映正确的标注。原研究的主要发现——即阳极钯膜促进氢气提取，从而增强热化学脱氢——并未受到影响。\n\n该研究属于化学工程、电催化和多相催化领域，这些领域通常涉及复杂的实验装置和精确的数据呈现。作者与期刊迅速发布更正，彰显了透明度和严谨性，确保科学界能够依赖准确的信息。建议读者参阅更新后的版本以获取修正后的图表。", "text": "On 6 October 2026, Nature published an author correction to a study originally released on 9 September 2026. The paper, titled “Anodic Pd membrane H2 extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation,” was authored by Rui Zeng, Julian Ufert, Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey, and Yogesh Surendranath, affiliated with the Department of Chemistry and the Department of Chemical Engineering at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology. The correction addresses a labelling error in Figure 3c, where the far-left bar was mistakenly identified as “Pd-Ag under OCP” instead of “Pd under OCP.” Such corrections, while seemingly minor, are crucial for maintaining the integrity of the scientific record. The mislabelling could have led to misinterpretation of the experimental conditions, potentially affecting how other researchers replicate or build upon the work. The authors have updated both the HTML and PDF versions of the article to reflect the correct label. The original findings, which demonstrate that anodic palladium membranes facilitate hydrogen extraction and thereby enhance thermochemical dehydrogenation, remain unaffected. The study falls within the domains of chemical engineering, electrocatalysis, and heterogeneous catalysis, subjects that often involve intricate experimental setups and precise data representation. By promptly issuing this correction, the authors and the journal uphold transparency and rigor, ensuring that the scientific community can rely on accurate information. Readers are encouraged to refer to the updated version for the corrected figure.", "vocab": [{"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正", "note": "学术出版中常用，指对已发表内容的修正"}, {"word": "anodic", "pos": "adj", "zh": "阳极的", "note": "电化学术语，与阳极相关"}, {"word": "palladium", "pos": "noun", "zh": "钯", "note": "化学元素，符号Pd，常用于催化"}, {"word": "dehydrogenation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "脱氢", "note": "化学过程，指从分子中移除氢"}, {"word": "membrane", "pos": "noun", "zh": "膜", "note": "此处指用于分离氢气的钯膜"}, {"word": "thermochemical", "pos": "adj", "zh": "热化学的", "note": "涉及热与化学反应的"}, {"word": "mislabelling", "pos": "noun", "zh": "错误标注", "note": "指标签或标识不正确"}, {"word": "integrity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "诚信；完整性", "note": "常与科学记录搭配，指真实可靠"}, {"word": "replicate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重复（实验）", "note": "科研中指重复他人实验以验证结果"}, {"word": "electrocatalysis", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电催化", "note": "催化与电化学交叉领域"}, {"word": "heterogeneous catalysis", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "多相催化", "note": "催化剂与反应物不同相的催化"}, {"word": "transparency", "pos": "noun", "zh": "透明度", "note": "指公开、诚实的行为"}, {"word": "rigor", "pos": "noun", "zh": "严谨", "note": "学术研究中指严格精确"}, {"word": "uphold", "pos": "verb", "zh": "维护； uphold", "note": "此处指坚持原则或标准"}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H<sub>2</sub> extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 06 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n06 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation\nRui Zeng\n(\n曾瑞\n)\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-7577-767X\n1\n,\nJulian Ufert\nORCID:\norcid.org/0009-0004-6031-5773\n2\n,\nBryan Y. Tang\n1\n,\nRyan P. Bisbey\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0001-8699-5077\n1\n&\n…\nYogesh Surendranath\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-1016-3420\n1\n,\n2\nShow authors\nNature\n(\n2026\n)\nCite this article\nSave article\nView saved research\nThe\nOriginal Article\nwas published on 09 September 2026\nExplore related subjects\nDiscover the latest articles and news in related subjects.\nChemical engineering\nElectrocatalysis\nHeterogeneous catalysis\nCorrection to:\nNature\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-11008-2\nPublished online 9 September 2026\nIn the version of the article initially published, the far-left bar in Fig. 3c was labelled “Pd-Ag under OCP” but should have been labelled “Pd under OCP”. This correction has been made to the HTML and PDF versions of the article.\nAuthor information\nAuthors and Affiliations\nDepartment of Chemistry, Massachusetts Institute of Technology, Cambridge, MA, USA\nRui Zeng\n(\n曾瑞\n), Bryan Y. Tang, Ryan P. Bisbey & Yoges